cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOOtation in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "MOOtation: a header-only C++17 library of multi- and many-objective evolutionary algorithms"
abstract: >-
  MOOtation is a dependency-free, header-only C++17 library of 60 multi- and
  many-objective evolutionary algorithms — Pareto-dominance, decomposition,
  indicator-based, reference-vector, clustering-based and archive-based —
  implemented from their primary publications. Every source file records the
  paper it follows, the paper's default parameters with the section they come
  from, and an explicit list of any deviations or resolved ambiguities.
type: software
